# TransitiveObjectProperty(r) desugars to the chain r o r subseteq r.
# RDF-surface vocabulary the abstract grammar already covers -- failing to decode
# it drops an axiom the ontology depends on (SPEC 5.2).

@prefix :    <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:TransitiveProperty .
